{"name":"Fiddlesticks","hex":"#bb9fb1","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"fiddlesticks","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Interjection","definitions":["Nonsense! Expresses dismissal or disdain.","Darn! Expresses mild dismay or annoyance."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of fiddlestick"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/fiddlesticks"}],"entries":[{"title":"Fiddlesticks","blocks":[{"text":"Fiddlesticks are traditional instruments used to add percussion to old-time and Cajun fiddle music, allowing two people to play the fiddle at the same time. While the fiddler plays in normal fashion, a second person uses a pair of straws, sticks, or knitting needles to tap out a rhythm on the strings over the upper fingerboard."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/3/31/Emilyplayingthestraws.jpg/330px-Emilyplayingthestraws.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fiddlesticks"},{"title":"Fiddlesticks (1930 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Fiddlesticks is a 1930 American animated comedy short film directed and animated by Ub Iwerks, in his first cartoon since he departed from Walt Disney's studio. The short features Iwerks' character Flip the Frog."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Flip_the_Frog_-_Fiddlesticks_poster.jpg/330px-Flip_the_Frog_-_Fiddlesticks_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fiddlesticks_(1930_film)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Rileybaugusfiddlesticks.jpg/500px-Rileybaugusfiddlesticks.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Rileybaugusfiddlesticks.jpg/500px-Rileybaugusfiddlesticks.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Ira Bernstein playing fiddlesticks with Riley Baugus","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARileybaugusfiddlesticks.jpg"}],"sounds":{"fiddlesticks":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f2/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-fiddlesticks.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f2/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-fiddlesticks.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-fiddlesticks.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f2/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-fiddlesticks.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-fiddlesticks.wav.ogg"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Madeira Grey Cat","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Madeira_Grey_Cat.JPG/500px-Madeira_Grey_Cat.JPG","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Madeira_Grey_Cat.JPG","share":0.184375},{"title":"Swallow Prominent on a grey wall","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Swallow_Prominent_on_a_grey_wall.jpg/500px-Swallow_Prominent_on_a_grey_wall.jpg","ratio":1,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Swallow_Prominent_on_a_grey_wall.jpg","share":0.181875},{"title":"Grey Bushchat in Sillery Gaon March 2025 by Tisha Mukherjee 01","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Grey_Bushchat_in_Sillery_Gaon_March_2025_by_Tisha_Mukherjee_01.jpg/500px-Grey_Bushchat_in_Sillery_Gaon_March_2025_by_Tisha_Mukherjee_01.jpg","ratio":1.3997488488907492,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_Bushchat_in_Sillery_Gaon_March_2025_by_Tisha_Mukherjee_01.jpg","share":0.125},{"title":"Scala di grigi","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Scala_di_grigi.jpg/500px-Scala_di_grigi.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Scala_di_grigi.jpg","share":0.094375},{"title":"Flip the